cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use MemoryGuard in your research, please cite this repository."
title: "MemoryGuard: Bounded Active Memory Maintenance for Long-Horizon Embodied Agents"
abstract: >-
  MemoryGuard studies stale object memory in long-horizon embodied agents and provides a bounded
  verify-update-act loop for active memory maintenance, with pre-registered paired evaluations in
  AI2-THOR and held-out replication on unseen scenes, target classes, and seeds.
